{"id":"3a019df3a337399a","group":"89","path":"89/89-prop-p-morphism-preserves.md","title":"P-morphism Preserves Validity","display":"prop-p-morphism-preserves — P-morphism Preserves Validity","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-prop-p-morphism-preserves","aliases":["89-prop-p-morphism-preserves"],"display":"prop-p-morphism-preserves — P-morphism Preserves Validity","depends_on":["[[89-df-p-morphism]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-valid-modal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-prop-p-morphism-preserves"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-prop-p-morphism-preserves</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-p-morphism-preserves — P-morphism Preserves Validity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f92b2b6a2706404b\" href=\"?note=f92b2b6a2706404b\" title=\"89-df-p-morphism\">89-df-p-morphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dbba58e7bd3b0667\" href=\"?note=dbba58e7bd3b0667\" title=\"89-df-valid-modal\">89-df-valid-modal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}_1=(W_1,R_1)\">\\(\\mathcal{F}_1=(W_1,R_1)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}_2=(W_2,R_2)\">\\(\\mathcal{F}_2=(W_2,R_2)\\)</span> are Kripke frames.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:W_1\\twoheadrightarrow W_2\">\\(f:W_1\\twoheadrightarrow W_2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pMorphism}(f;\\mathcal F_1,\\mathcal F_2)\">\\(\\mathrm{pMorphism}(f;\\mathcal F_1,\\mathcal F_2)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}p\\text{-}morphism\\text{-}preserves}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{pMorphism}(f;\\mathcal F_1,\\mathcal F_2)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal{F}_1\\models\\varphi\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathcal{F}_2\\models\\varphi\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}p\\text{-}morphism\\text{-}preserves}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{pMorphism}(f;\\mathcal F_1,\\mathcal F_2)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal{F}_1\\models\\varphi\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathcal{F}_2\\models\\varphi\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> : p-态射 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f92b2b6a2706404b\" href=\"?note=f92b2b6a2706404b\" title=\"89-df-p-morphism\">89-df-p-morphism</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> : 有效性</li>\n<li>满射 p-态射把定义域框架的有效性传递到像框架</li>\n<li>模态逻辑语义不变性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-p-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"f92b2b6a2706404b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-p-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-valid-modal","status":"resolved","id":"dbba58e7bd3b0667","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-valid-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-p-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"f92b2b6a2706404b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$f$ : p-态射 (see [[89-df-p-morphism]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}_1=(W_1,R_1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}_2=(W_2,R_2)","display":false},{"tex":"f:W_1\\twoheadrightarrow W_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pMorphism}(f;\\mathcal F_1,\\mathcal F_2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}p\\text{-}morphism\\text{-}preserves}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{pMorphism}(f;\\mathcal F_1,\\mathcal F_2)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal{F}_1\\models\\varphi\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathcal{F}_2\\models\\varphi\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\models","display":false}],"bytes":1030,"backlinks":[{"id":"f92b2b6a2706404b","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-prop-p-morphism-preserves]]：p-态射保持有效性"}],"outgoing":["f92b2b6a2706404b","56c1b5b75a32ca1d","dbba58e7bd3b0667"]}